    "readmeMarkdown": "## MarkItDown\n\nRuns Microsoft's local MarkItDown MCP server over STDIO for local trusted agents. It exposes `convert_to_markdown(uri)` for `file:`, `http:`, `https:`, and `data:` URIs. The server runs with the current user's file and network access, so review URI inputs and avoid exposing HTTP or SSE modes beyond localhost."
